Z||000000||firstfiero||05-23-2001||07:11 PM||||     I'm droping it off towmorrow at the mechanic but befor I do I want to ask a few questions. 1) My heating coil blew a week a go...will that cause air to get in my system. That seems to be the overheating problem again! 2) my mechanic is to busy but he said he can by pass the heating coil for me until he gets a chance to put a new one.  how hard is it for me to do it myself and get the air out of the system!   Thanks<P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">         <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||14
